      <description>A night of performances and raw improvisation, brought together by Amsterdam’s aural conduct record label and Studio Tumbuh. Celebrating the CD release of the first-time collaborations between these artists, focusing on experimentalism, musical tension and autonomy. Disorienting rhythms, suspended live electronics and instrumentation scattered across cultures, resonant with DIY, punk and club.</description>
